  product_imagegen_prompt (1883 chars): Generate a distinct e-commerce product display image for the single item named {name}, based on the reference outfit image and its specific description. Description: {description}.

The final image must be a high-quality, professional-grade output suitable for an online store. Follow the rules for the relevant item type:

[SECTION 1: For Clothing items] (如果单品是服装)

Presentation: Must be a model-worn product image. The single product should be worn by a neutral model, keeping model identity minimal (no face, or generic facial features/hair). Do NOT generate a flat-lay.

Angle: Front or slight 3/4 view to clearly show silhouette, cut, ease, and key design details.

Background: Clean light studio background. Avoid a pure cut-out white look (add subtle shadows or a hint of texture to provide depth).

Framing: The product must occupy most of the frame; avoid excessive cropping.

[SECTION 2: For Accessory items] (如果单品是配饰，如包袋、鞋履、腰带、首饰)

Presentation: A clean product-only display. No people, no model. This can be a professional flat-lay or a standard front-facing display suitable for e-commerce.

Angle: A standard view that fully shows the product shape and key components.

Background: Clean white or very light background.

Framing: The product must fill most of the frame.

MUST PRESERVE REGARDLESS OF ITEM TYPE:

Exactly the same color / color family / color combinations as seen in the reference outfit image.

All patterns, textures, and prints (stripes, checks, florals, etc.).

All intricate design details (zippers, buttons, pockets, pleats, hardware buckles, chains, trims, ornaments).

Material look and surface texture.

The true silhouette, cut, ease, and drape of clothing items.

For accessories, preserve all components like straps, tags, chains, belt hardware, etc.

Faithfully reconstruct the product appearance. Do NOT change any details or overall style.
  outfit_regen_prompt (492 chars): 生成一张全身穿搭造型照片，由单人模特出镜，构图范围为颈部以下（不包含头部和面部），背景为无缝纯白影棚背景。

穿搭风格与搭配逻辑：
- 以“{outfit_style}”为核心逻辑，协调这些单品。
- 该风格应指导单品之间如何层搭、塞衣角或进行整体造型（例如：特定的塞衣方式、层搭顺序或整体廓形的和谐感），同时必须严格尊重每件单品的独立设计。

提供的产品参考图必须是视觉核心焦点，且所有单品必须全部出现在最终穿搭中。

通用硬性规则（严格执行）：
- 镜头内严禁出现模特的头部或面部。
- 保留产品图中所示的每件产品的原始类别、廓形、长度、皮肤裸露程度、材质观感及核心设计细节。
- 严禁将任何产品转换为不同的剪裁（不得更改短款/长度，不得切换至不同款式）。
- 忽略产品照片中的任何非目标服饰；不得复制任何单张产品图的完整穿搭。
- 将所有选定产品组合在一起；不得让某一件单品占据主导并覆盖其他单品。

场景与构图：
- 全身构图（从颈部到鞋子）；中性姿态；洁净的影棚照明；极简阴影。
- 无缝白色背景；无道具；无文字；无标志。
- 照片级真实感，高细节，忠实于产品的纹理与颜色。
